# nl2yaml: mined corpus is a 43 MB derived artifact, regenerable with
#   python -m tools.nl2yaml.mine --csv <the gitignored CSV>
# Committing it puts a fresh 43 MB blob in history on every miner tweak. The
# conclusions drawn from it (funnel.json / measure.json / gaps.jsonl /
# funnel_report.md) are small and ARE tracked, so the numbers stay reviewable.
# Note this also removes it from test_privacy's "publishable files" sweep —
# correct, because a PR no longer publishes it.
tools/nl2yaml/dataset/candidates.jsonl

# 對照內部 Confluence 案例文件寫成的能力審核報告。內容含未發布的產品規格與
